<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαν-έχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold up, support,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ οἰκεῖα πάθη τοῖς δημοσίοις
					ἐπανέχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>take upon oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν πρὸς Γέτας πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap.Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανέσχετο.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.115
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> seemingly
			intr. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span>), <i>rest upon,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ταῖς ἐλπίσιν</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.51
			</span></i>; <i>to be contented with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.38
				</span></i>
			; <i>rely on, rest contented with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς βιβλίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					1.12
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαναπαύομαι.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat., <i>attend to,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1033.6
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
